#EMBEDDED_NOTES
#This example demonstrates a batch of runs that iterates the target speed for the Quick Start Double Lane Change maneuver.
#
#To run this example, use the matlab script batch_iteration_runSL.m to iterate the import IMP_SPEED to set the target speed to 80 kph, 90 kph, 100 kph, 110 kph, & 120 kph over the consecutive runs.
#
#This example is set to save the last five results - four of the stored results are set as overlaid runs for the last. If the example is rerun, the overlaid results must be reselected.
#END_EMBEDDED_NOTES

